MODULE: HistoryKeepsSupersededLatestOnly
TARGET: HistoryKeepsSuperseded
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: history incorrectly borrows replacement admission and discards a superseded ordinary revision
PERTURBS: ReadOrdinary

--- FIND
    /\ history' = history \cup Revision({1})
--- REPLACE
    /\ history' = IF Eligible(1, members) THEN history \cup Revision({1}) ELSE history
--- END
